    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/31b54fa20559c06f2bb8b6abff8dead3.poster.avif?t=1736292229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/31b54fa20559c06f2bb8b6abff8dead3.webm?t=1736292229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/31b54fa20559c06f2bb8b6abff8dead3.mp4?t=1736292229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>High Elo Girls</strong> is an esports visual novel about ambition, competition, and pursuing your dreams to become stronger.  Experience the career of a newly minted professional player; from her initial trials, all the way to finally competing in a major tournament.  Along the way you\u2019ll confront themes of new adulthood, trust, rivalry and the challenges we face when we embrace the climb.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A newcomer-friendly tour of the MOBA esports scene<br></li><li>5 Team Roles to Play (Top Lane, Jungle, Mid Lane, DPS, and Support)<br></li><li>5 Teammates to Befriend, Romance, or Antagonize<br></li><li>Choice-based MOBA Simulations featuring narrative-changing decisions</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embrace your dreams</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/1ff9147d9aca3f2f563a06e4b6cda728.poster.avif?t=1736292229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/1ff9147d9aca3f2f563a06e4b6cda728.webm?t=1736292229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/1ff9147d9aca3f2f563a06e4b6cda728.mp4?t=1736292229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You play as Rafaela, a college dropout with more regrets than qualifications.  The only arena you have any shred of confidence left is also your only escape: the popular MOBA, <i>Reckoners of Forsaken Lands</i>.<br><br>But when you\u2019re invited to join Momentum Gaming (MMG), you finally have the chance to prove to the world, what you\u2019re really made of.  But, the job demands not just your skill in <i>Reckoners</i>, but in negotiating relationships with your ambitious new teammates too.  Can you rise to the challenge, or will this end up being just another squandered opportunity?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Navigate the competition</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/b3e15814782cc81043278d4ce226c0d3.poster.avif?t=1736292229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/b3e15814782cc81043278d4ce226c0d3.webm?t=1736292229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/b3e15814782cc81043278d4ce226c0d3.mp4?t=1736292229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Engage in choice-based matches that impact Rafaela\u2019s life in and out of her career.  Are you a reliable follower closing the deal on your team\u2019s plans; a showstopper making the daring plays that hit social media; or a wildcard who leaves nothing off the table?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trust in your team...</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/0585c326ceab802729be1a226ddf1d14.avif?t=1736292229\" /></div><br>Each of your five MMG teammates bring their own perspectives and goals with them. Building friendships, rivalries, and more, will be key to cementing your place in the team.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2026Or break away on your own</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/3cfa8f44b6a38c98b6abade73be8f0b6.avif?t=1736292229\" /></div><br>For someone truly willing to stop at nothing to reach their goals, there may be other paths to discover, provided you\u2019re able to stomach them.<br><br>Wishlist us today and look forward to future development updates!<br>\u2728 The Split Fate Team",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/31b54fa20559c06f2bb8b6abff8dead3.poster.avif?t=1736292229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/31b54fa20559c06f2bb8b6abff8dead3.webm?t=1736292229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/31b54fa20559c06f2bb8b6abff8dead3.mp4?t=1736292229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>High Elo Girls</strong> is an esports visual novel about ambition, competition, and pursuing your dreams to become stronger.  Experience the career of a newly minted professional player; from her initial trials, all the way to finally competing in a major tournament.  Along the way you\u2019ll confront themes of new adulthood, trust, rivalry and the challenges we face when we embrace the climb.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A newcomer-friendly tour of the MOBA esports scene<br></li><li>5 Team Roles to Play (Top Lane, Jungle, Mid Lane, DPS, and Support)<br></li><li>5 Teammates to Befriend, Romance, or Antagonize<br></li><li>Choice-based MOBA Simulations featuring narrative-changing decisions</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embrace your dreams</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/1ff9147d9aca3f2f563a06e4b6cda728.poster.avif?t=1736292229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/1ff9147d9aca3f2f563a06e4b6cda728.webm?t=1736292229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/1ff9147d9aca3f2f563a06e4b6cda728.mp4?t=1736292229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>You play as Rafaela, a college dropout with more regrets than qualifications.  The only arena you have any shred of confidence left is also your only escape: the popular MOBA, <i>Reckoners of Forsaken Lands</i>.<br><br>But when you\u2019re invited to join Momentum Gaming (MMG), you finally have the chance to prove to the world, what you\u2019re really made of.  But, the job demands not just your skill in <i>Reckoners</i>, but in negotiating relationships with your ambitious new teammates too.  Can you rise to the challenge, or will this end up being just another squandered opportunity?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Navigate the competition</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/b3e15814782cc81043278d4ce226c0d3.poster.avif?t=1736292229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/b3e15814782cc81043278d4ce226c0d3.webm?t=1736292229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/b3e15814782cc81043278d4ce226c0d3.mp4?t=1736292229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Engage in choice-based matches that impact Rafaela\u2019s life in and out of her career.  Are you a reliable follower closing the deal on your team\u2019s plans; a showstopper making the daring plays that hit social media; or a wildcard who leaves nothing off the table?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trust in your team...</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/0585c326ceab802729be1a226ddf1d14.avif?t=1736292229\" /></div><br>Each of your five MMG teammates bring their own perspectives and goals with them. Building friendships, rivalries, and more, will be key to cementing your place in the team.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2026Or break away on your own</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735080/extras/3cfa8f44b6a38c98b6abade73be8f0b6.avif?t=1736292229\" /></div><br>For someone truly willing to stop at nothing to reach their goals, there may be other paths to discover, provided you\u2019re able to stomach them.<br><br>Wishlist us today and look forward to future development updates!<br>\u2728 The Split Fate Team",
